name: Canio — face-destroy X-mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Canio gains X1 Mult when a face card is destroyed. First-shop legendary from The Soul:
  find it in Ante 1 Arcana/Spectral packs and destroy face cards (Immolate, Death,
  debuff bosses) to scale it.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - legendaryJoker: Canio
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      arcanaPacks: [0, 1]
      spectralPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - spectralCard: Immolate
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - tarotCard: Death
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Pareidolia
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
